d rock ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Some of the rock formations here look like animals.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le14ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to marvel ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be impressed or amazed ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I marvel at these rock formations! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le14ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "vista ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a wide open view from a high place ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We can see a vista of the ocean from up here.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le14ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "typical ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "usual; expected ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Typical young women love to go shopping.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le14ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "seasonal ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "for a certain season of the year ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Bring seasonal clothing on the fall trip.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le14ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "venture ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a trip to a new place ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We need a guide on the venture up to the volcano.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le14ob10aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "gear ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "special clothing or equipment for a sport or trip ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: When we climb, we use our mountain gear.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le14ob10aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "astonishing", "type": "name"}, {"content": "amazing; incredible ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The rocks in the canyon are astonishing.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le14ob10aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "priority ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "more  important than other things ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Safety in the wild is a priority. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le14ob10aud10", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Your soccer team is going to Buenos Aires to play a game.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Go on the Internet and see what you can do on days off in Buenos Aires. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make a list of what you should bring to this city. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write an e-mail to a friend going with you on how to prepare to be safe.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your e-mail aloud to a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about what to do on a trip.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I make suggestions on what to bring on a trip.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask for suggestions for activities on the trip.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I make suggestions on how to prepare for a trip.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn4le14ob10re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn4le14ob10re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Sally's Suitcase</span></br></br>People who venture into the Grand Canyon either can't wait to hike it again, or never want to. I loved the canyon. My friend Vanessa did not. So, we're typical.</p>"}, {"image": "engenn4le14ob10re2img02.jpg", "time": "14500", "id": 2, "text": "On our first day, we started down Bright Angel Trail. We saw astonishing rock formations and heard coyotes in the distance.</p>"}, {"image": "engenn4le14ob10re2img01.jpg", "time": "24000", "id": 3, "text": "On day two, we trekked up to a plateau. We camped and rested. We marveled at the vista! This is why everyone should bring a camera along.\n</p>On a shorter day trip, Vanessa wrenched her ankle. The rangers helped us out.</p>"}, {"image": "engenn4le14ob10re2img03.jpg", "time": "42000", "id": 4, "text": "Anyone attempting this trip should understand there are hazards. Prepare for the trip. Check online to see what seasonal gear you need. Safety is always a priority."}], "audiosrc": "engenn4le14ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le14ob10re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "text", "contents": [{"value": "Sally's Suitcase<br/><br/>\n\nPeople who venture into the Grand Canyon either can't wait to hike it again, or never want to. I loved the canyon. My friend Vanessa did not. So, we're typical.<br/><br/>\nOn our first day, we started down Bright Angel Trail. We saw astonishing rock formations and heard coyotes in the distance.\nOn day two, we trekked up to a plateau. We camped and rested. We marveled at the vista! This is why everyone should bring a camera along. <br/><br/>\nOn a shorter day trip, Vanessa wrenched her ankle. The rangers helped us out.<br/><br/>\nAnyone attempting this trip should understand there are hazards. Prepare for the trip. Check online to see what seasonal gear you need. Safety is always a priority.", "type": "p"}], "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can talk about things to do or take on a trip. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can report about things, actions and events.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can make suggestions. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Do you like outdoor adventures?  What kind?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Where do you want to go?  Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "It was an exciting trip!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Sally is an active blogger. What does she write about?", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Click on the play 